---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About the Project"
  description="ACTA FRAGILIA is an independent platform for long-form journalism, document analysis, and investigations in the fields of law, economics, corporate conflicts, and social processes."
  canonical="https://acta-fragilia.pages.dev/en/about"
>
  <div class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About the Project</h1>
      <p class="lead">ACTA FRAGILIA is an independent platform for long-form journalism, document analysis, and investigations in the fields of law, economics, corporate conflicts, and social processes.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-content container">
    <div class="about-layout">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>No advertising, no news feed, no noise. Only verifiable facts, context, and an attempt to understand how legal, economic, and social processes work — and who bears their consequences.</p>

        <h2>Methodology</h2>
        <p>Each material is built on primary sources: court decisions, legislative acts, financial reports, and interviews with participants. We do not publish breaking news — only what can be verified and commented on in context.</p>

        <h2>Rubrics</h2>
        <ul class="category-list">
          <li><strong>Law</strong> — Analysis of legislation, judicial practice, and legal conflicts.</li>
          <li><strong>Economics</strong> — Analysis of corporate conflicts, bankruptcies, tax, and financial mechanisms.</li>
          <li><strong>Society</strong> — Social processes, institutions, and their transformation.</li>
          <li><strong>Media</strong> — Information flows, journalism, and media literacy.</li>
          <li><strong>Conflict</strong> — Corporate and economic disputes in detail.</li>
          <li><strong>Document</strong> — Analysis of one specific document with comments.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Principles</h2>
        <ol class="principles">
          <li><strong>Verifiability.</strong> Every fact can be traced to its source.</li>
          <li><strong>Context.</strong> An event without context is not information, but noise.</li>
          <li><strong>Consequences.</strong> Not only what happened matters, but also what follows.</li>
          <li><strong>Independence.</strong> No advertising, no sponsors influencing editorial policy.</li>
        </ol>

        <h2>Author</h2>
        <p>The project is led by Kliment Vileysky. Contact: <a href="mailto:acta_fragilia@proton.me">acta_fragilia@proton.me</a></p>
      </div>

      <aside class="about-sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-block">
          <strong>Status</strong>
          <p>Independent project. Not a legal entity. Publications do not constitute legal advice.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-block">
          <strong>License</strong>
          <p>Materials are distributed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. When republishing, cite the source and preserve context.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-block">
          <strong>Updates</strong>
          <p>New materials are added as they are ready — without a fixed schedule, but with a commitment to quality.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .about-hero { padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-lg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
    .about-hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--step-3); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: var(--space-md); }
    .lead { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--step-1); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; max-width: 55ch; }
    .about-content { padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-2xl); }
    .about-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: min(var(--text-width), 100%) 1fr; gap: var(--space-xl); }
    .about-text { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--step-0); line-height: 1.75; }
    .about-text > * + * { margin-top: var(--space-md); }
    .about-text h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--step-2); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-top: var(--space-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); }
    .about-text p { max-width: var(--text-width); }
    .about-text a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }
    .about-text a:hover { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
    .category-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
    .category-list li { padding: var(--space-sm) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-family: var(--font-ui); line-height: 1.6; }
    .category-list li:first-child { padding-top: 0; }
    .category-list strong { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
    .principles { padding-left: var(--space-md); }
    .principles li { margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); line-height: 1.6; }
    .principles strong { color: var(--ink); }
    .about-sidebar { padding-top: var(--space-sm); }
    .sidebar-block { padding: var(--space-md); background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); margin-bottom: var(--space-md); }
    .sidebar-block strong { display: block; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--step--1); font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); }
    .sidebar-block p { font-family: var(--font-ui); font-size: var(--step--1); color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; }
    @media (max-width: 768px) { .about-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  </style>
</Base>